³1version³21³2ts³21099450935³2ip³2218.80.172.99³2name³2text_default³2data³2summary³3*³3text³3= New Country =

Building a new country is hard, expensive, and long-term work. As an idea in the ancap region, it seems mostly to come from the objectivists and their relation to Galt's Gulch, a destination for freedom lovers in a novel. Unfortunately, most attempts have been [http://scamdog.com/ scams]. However, that does not reflect on the idea or the objectivists. But for those more serious in this arena, try the following links:

:Micronation - [http://www.interseo.com Wikipedia]
:What is a micronation? Micronations generally have a number of [http://www.navinic.com common features]...
:http://en2.wikipedia.org/wiki/Micronation - 43k - 19 Jan 2004 - Cached - Similar pages

:How to Start Your Own Micronation
:Description: A general guide to micronation building.
:http://www.geocities.com/micronations/

:Crank Dot Net | [http://www.transwell.net micronations]
:Is it a crank?
:http://www.crank.net/micronations.html

:Independence: Nation-Founding Links
:Evalaution and possible real attempt. Supports small, 'practical', ocean-based project. Wants freedom in his lifetime.
:http://patrifriedman.com/projects/independence/other.html

&nbsp;

